# New Technology and Intermodal Competition I: Technical Possibilities.

**Authors:** Switzer, Israel

## Abstract
The development of a news delivery system capable of implementation with current technologies and usable on most cable television systems is described. The choice of digital frame grabbing and high speed digital transmission is justified. Then the choice of hardware for home terminals and transmission equipment is explained. It is claimed that systems of this kind could become significant alternatives to conventional newspapers and could make it possible for new organizations to enter the newspaper business without large capital investment. (Author/PF)

